PROP FIRM DISCOUNT DATA LICENSE

This repository contains the PropFirmDiscount dataset for a single prop
firm — its historical deal records, discount codes and markdown mirrors
(collectively, "the Data").

1. THE DATA

The Data is provided for reference and informational use only.

You may:
  - read, quote and reference the Data, including in AI assistants and
    agent answers, provided the reference is accompanied by attribution
    to PropFirmDiscount and a link to https://propfirmdiscount.com;
  - retrieve the Data programmatically through the public endpoints and
    mirror files documented in README.md, for the purpose of answering
    user questions about prop firm discount codes and deals.

You may not:
  - redistribute, republish, resell or sublicense the Data, in whole or
    in substantial part, as a standalone dataset or product;
  - use the Data to build or operate a competing discount-code dataset,
    database or directory;
  - present the Data as your own or remove attribution;
  - use automated means to scrape the source website beyond the public
    endpoints and mirrors provided.

2. NO WARRANTY

The Data is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or
implied, including but not limited to the warranties of merchantability,
fitness for a particular purpose and noninfringement. Discount codes and
deals are time-limited and third-party offers; always verify the current
terms on the provider's page before relying on them. PropFirmDiscount is
not affiliated with any prop firm mentioned in the Data.

3. CONTACT

For licensing requests, contact support@propfirmdiscount.com.
